      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I dwe me Nican, i mwaka me pyeraryo meloc pa kabaka Aritak cec, ma onoŋo kabaka tye ka cam, akwanyo koŋo vino atero bote. Onoŋo yam peya abedo ki cwercwiny mo i nyime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka ocako penya ni, “Piŋo waŋi nen ki can, inen calo komi yot do? Man can mo aye tye i cwinyi.” Cutcut lworo ocako maka woko marac, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.25.8+2KI.25.9+2KI.25.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Luker 25.8-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tek 36.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.52.12+JER.52.13+JER.52.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 52.12-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci agamo dog kabaka ni, “Kabaka obed kwo nakanaka! Waŋa pe twero nen ki can piŋo, ma kun kono gaŋ kal ka ma giyiko iye kwarowa ducu doŋ odoko obur, ma dog gaŋŋe giwaŋo woko liweŋ ki mac?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka dok openya ni, “Doŋ imito gin aŋo kono?” Cutcut alego Lubaŋa me polo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka doŋ agamo dog kabaka ni, “Ka ce ineno ni ber, laditta kabaka, ka itwero ye legana, wek acit i lobo me Juda i gaŋ kal ka ma kwarowa giyikogi iye, wek aciyub gaŋ meno odoco.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka odokka iye ma onoŋo daker mere obedo ka ŋete, owacci, “Wot meno biteri kare ma rom mene, dok ibidwogo awene?” Ci atitte bene nino ma abia iye kikome; kabaka oye pi citona kunnu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok awaco bot kabaka ni, “Ka ce ineno ni ber, myero gico waraga ci imiya ater bot luloc ma i lobo ma tye Loka Kulu, ma tito botgi ni myero guye akat acit i Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok apenyo kabaka bene ni myero oco waraga omiya ater bot Acap, ma lagwok buŋa pa kabaka, wek omiya yadi wek giti ki bao pi dogcel me gogo ma gwoko ot pa Lubaŋa, ki pi cel ma orumo gaŋ, ki pi ot ma an abibedo iye.” Kabaka oye ci omiya gin ducu ma alege pire, pien Lubaŋa onoŋo tye ka konya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka ocwalo an kacel ki ludito me mony ki dul pa wegi aguragura, ci acito i lobo ma tye Loka Kulu tuŋ potoceŋ, ci amiyo waraga pa kabaka bot luloc me lobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Canbalat ma jo Bet-koron, ki Tobia ma en jo Ammon, ka guwinyo lok man, ci gubedo ki keco i cwinygi matek pien guŋeyo ni dano mo obino pi konyo kor jo Icrael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acito i Jerucalem ci ari kunnu pi nino adek, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma pe atito bot ŋat mo tam ma Lubaŋa otyeko keto i cwinya ma myero ati kwede pi Jerucalem. Cutcut i cwiny dyewor aa malo wacako wot kacel ki lurema mogo. Pe onoŋo watye ki lee mo mukene kono kana ma abedo i wiye-ni keken. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akato acito woko i dyewor kun awok i dogcel me cito i nota nio kwede i waŋ It pa Too ki i dogcel ma cito wi odur, ci acako niyo cel me Jerucalem ducu ma yam gimuko opoto woko piny, kacel ki dogcel ducu ma yam giwaŋo woko liweŋ ki mac-ci. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok alokke acito i Dogcel me Wan It ki i Kut pa Kabaka. Kana ma abedo i wiye-ni onoŋo pe twero noŋo yo mo ma myero ekat ki iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno aa i dyewor acito ka ŋiyo cel kun awok ki i nota; ka adok cen i gaŋ ki i dogcel ma ci to i nota, ki yo ma acito kwede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe tye ŋat mo i kin ludito ma giloyo lwak ma oneyo ka ma acito iye ki gin ma abedo ka tiyone. Onoŋo peya atito gin mo bot Lujudaya, ajwagi, ludito ma giloyo lwak ducu, kadi ki bot jo mukene ma onoŋo myero guti tic meno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka doŋ awaco botgi ni, “Wunen kit ayela ma watye kwede kombeddi, wunen Jerucalem doŋ odoko obur, wa dog celle ducu giwaŋo woko. Wubin wacaku gero cel me Jerucalem odoco, wek lewic pe obed ka makowa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok atitogi kit macalo Lubaŋa obedo kweda dok okonya maber,’ kacel ki lok ducu ma cen kabaka owacca. Gin gugamo ni, “Wacaku gerone odoco.” Ci guyubbe me cako tic cut, gujiŋo badgi me tiyo tic maber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ka Canbalat ma jo Bet-koron, Tobia ma latic, ma jo Ammon, ki Gecem ma Laarab guwinyo pi gin ma watye ka tiyone, gucako nywarowa kun gicayowa bene ma giwacci, “Man gin aŋo ma wutye ka tiyone-rii? Wun wumito jemo i kom kabaka?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An adok iye botgi ni, “Lubaŋa me polo aye bikonyowa, wan luticce, wabicako gedo. Ento pe tye dul mo ma gipoko ki wun i Jerucalem, kadi wa twero mo, nyinwu bene pe gipo pire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
